(text "Three TPS563201 bucks from VBUS (SLVSD90B Table 7-2: R2 = 10k, L = 2.2 uH, 2 x 22 uF out). 3.3 V\ndigital; 2.5 V pre-regulator for the TVP7002 1.9 V LDOs (OSSC pattern); 1.2 V FX3 core. EN has an\ninternal pull-down, so it is tied up through 100k." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 203 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "063bdf24-0e8b-429f-b35a-a5d9090ac511"))
